"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫What are you doing in here?!⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫You can’t just go prancing into a boy’s "
"bedchamber!⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫Leave that to the servants!"
