msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫I ⟪k:2⟫did⟪k:3⟫ send one for you.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫You’re the one who refused to wake up."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫哎呀，⟪k:2⟫我已经派人来过了哦？⟪k:3⟫明明是哥哥大人没及时起床嘛。"

#: scenario:scenario_763FE9C2_8077_476B_9911_3C7CB758C0A5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
