msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Besides, it’s not like we’re strangers.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫We used to sleep together all the time."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫更何况，⟪k:2⟫以我们之间的关系还有什么好害羞的嘛。⟪k:3⟫哥哥大人以前还和奈莉一起睡呢！"

#: scenario:scenario_F2E70E44_FAC3_4A37_AF6F_19A9515D2A80
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 269c9d362b12829e7f49a4c7a20d0331b664d5edf486be1be523228eea66468e
