msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫以前是以前，⟪k:2⟫现在是现在……"

#: scenario:scenario_EA83B011_92EC_4FBD_A5C8_E4DD58EDC6E6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: daddca06ba0ca9b1fed8c7c3dc53050d0ec49c4b5178fb0b070e3260285ae2bb
