msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Oh, you’re overthinking it, silly.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Now hurry up—⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫out of bed, "
"sleepyhead!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫真是的，⟪k:2⟫哥哥大人想多了啦。⟪k:3⟫快点，⟪k:4⟫大懒虫！⟪k:5⟫起床了！"

#: scenario:scenario_3BDEC31B_4982_4FF5_9ECB_5B5E1B0DD9E3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 32390ef990f05ae89dc97719ddd84d6218336aec81fa7a56203490153598383e
