msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫与其说睡懒觉，⟪k:2⟫倒更像是彻夜未眠的样子！"

#: scenario:scenario_F6D5B2ED_5CF9_4699_84A9_D00BDB0FE885
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 739c232d9d14197121b9d237a17561b73e5f927d5735dee177627bdc3e5d07ef
