msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫真、⟪k:2⟫真的么！？"

#: scenario:scenario_CA7AF55F_919F_44AE_AA6F_B113BFB2D8E2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f6d375ae13b0542dce0d2b5a095694f9c2dfb4df784c1c0a30acd37dfb396a96
